WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.635
Everything inside Mars, going round.

00:03.352 --> 00:09.727
Every second here is six days, so Mercury goes round the Sun in fifteen seconds and the Earth in a minute.

00:10.430 --> 00:15.460
Each planet is a dot drawn far larger than it is, on the path it really follows.
